abstract: >-
  Software and public aggregate artifacts for a point-in-time study of whether
  options-market information improves forecasts of 30-minute realized variance.
  The corrected-protocol RP2-v3 rebuild is complete, but no current scientific
  headline is eligible while the PIT v2.2 reconciliation gate remains closed.
